  "text": "Tomato late blight can cause large, dark-brown leaf blotches with green-gray edges. Spots are not limited by the leaf\u2019s major veins, and infection can spread through leaflets and leaf stems. Tomato fruit can develop firm, dark-brown spots. In humid conditions, thin white growth may appear on infected leaves, stems, or fruit.",
